<td align="left" valign="top"><img src="images/list.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('show similar interactions','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()" onclick="var targ=document.getElementById('div_4383235').style; if (targ.visibility=='hidden') {targ.height='auto'; targ.overflow='auto'; targ.visibility='visible'; targ.border='thin solid green';} else {targ.visibility='hidden'; targ.overflow='hidden'; targ.height='1px'; targ.border='none'}"> Physical interaction of CSNK1D; PER2 gene<div id="div_4383235" style="height:1px; overflow:hidden; width:100%; visibility:hidden; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><table style="width:100%%"><colgroup><col width="86%%"><col width="9%%"><col width="5%%"></colgroup><tr style="font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>similar interactions</td><td>matching information</td><td>external links</td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>csnk1d-per2-2</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/intact/search/do/search?searchString=EBI-23052057" target="_blank" style="color:#00aaaa;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Intact">I</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>csnk1d-per2-1</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/intact/search/do/search?searchString=EBI-24919717" target="_blank" style="color:#00aaaa;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Intact">I</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>csnk1d-per2-3</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/intact/search/do/search?searchString=EBI-15900198" target="_blank" style="color:#00aaaa;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Intact">I</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>csnk1d-per2-5</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/intact/search/do/search?searchString=EBI-24428236" target="_blank" style="color:#00aaaa;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Intact">I</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>Interaction of CSNK1D; PER2</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://dip.doe-mbi.ucla.edu/dip/DIPview.cgi?ID=DIP-188215E" target="_blank" style="color:#ff55ff;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Dip">D</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>Physical interaction of CSNK1D and PER2 gene</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.hprd.org/summary?hprd_id=17596&isoform_id=17596_1&isoform_name" target="_blank" style="color:#aa5500;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Hprd">H</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>CSNK1D-PER2</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.thebiogrid.org/SearchResults/summary/107837" target="_blank" style="color:#55ff55;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Biogrid">B</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>PER2-CSNK1D</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.thebiogrid.org/SearchResults/summary/114387" target="_blank" style="color:#55ff55;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Biogrid">B</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>CSNK1D (CKIdelta) interacts with PER2.</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/no.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Different info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/Tools/webservices/psicquic/view/main.xhtml?conversationContext=1" target="_blank" style="color:#ffdbab;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Bind">B</a></td></tr><tr style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;"><td>Interaction of casein kinase 1, delta and period homolog 2 (Drosophila)</td><td><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>stoichiometry','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>posttranslational modification','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"><img src="images/yes.png" onmouseover="ddrivetip('Same info on<br>cellular localization','#cbe6cb')" onmouseout="hideddrivetip()"></td><td><a href="http://kinase.bioinformatics.tw/" target="_blank" style="color:#b7b700;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt;" title="Phosphopoint">P</a></td></tr></table></div></td>
